' Viewport: the window resized and switched to fullscreen and back in the
' middle of a game — the world map, a place, a talk dialog, a room, Options —
' each scene laid out again at the new size and the game going on as if
' nothing had happened. Run with `preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30
' party give item_rat_trap window 640x480`, once as it is (NewGfx) and once
' with `newgfx off`. v12_viewport_still is the same script with every
' resize and switch a `resize 640x480`, which at that size changes nothing:
' the two give the same game lines and the same save (no reset, no time
' passing), and only this one says `window:`. `snap` pictures are written
' at the backbuffer's size.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map
wait 3
snap map_640
resize 1280x720          ' the world map, wider: 455 x 213
wait 3
snap map_1280
f11                      ' fullscreen at the desktop's size
wait 3
snap map_full
f11                      ' back: the window as it opened (resetWindowSize)
wait 3
snap map_back
resize 200x150           ' smaller than the frame: 1x, a 107 x 67 game, a 75 x 27 view
wait 3
snap map_200
resize 640x480
wait 3
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
resize 1920x1080         ' a place at 2x: 512 x 240
wait 3
snap place_1920
resize 640x480
wait 3
clickon 106              ' the mercenary: his talk
wait 30
snap talk_640
resize 1280x720          ' the dialog centred on the wider view again
wait 3
snap talk_1280
resize 640x480
wait 3
esc                      ' the talk closed
wait 5
join                     ' camped here: the place is ours
wait 10
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent
wait 200
snap room_640
resize 1920x1080         ' the room's scene centred in a wider game
wait 3
snap room_1920
resize 640x480
wait 3
uiclick 168,248          ' the rat trap put down, at the size the script was written for
wait 5
esc
wait 10
press o                  ' Options
wait 5
snap options_640
resize 1280x720
wait 3
snap options_1280
f11
wait 3
snap options_full
f11
wait 3
press escape             ' Back: the scene closes
wait 5
save
quit
